---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h2>Hello, Nice to meet you!</h2>
			<p>
				Welcome to the official website for Nicole Donny's blog
			</p>

			<h3>I want an extraordinary life, so I will do extraordinary things.</h3>
			<p>
				I'm a computer engineering graduate from a small town in Borneo, Malaysia, with a passion for 					creating and a lifelong dream of becoming a pilot.

				This is my little corner of the internet—a place where I share the things I'm learning, the experiences 				that shape me, and the ideas that make me stop and think.

				I write about self-development, technology, aviation, books, fitness, and the messy process of figuring 				life out. Sometimes I'll share something I've learned. Sometimes I'll share something I'm still trying to 				understand. And sometimes, I'll simply tell you about something I enjoyed.

				I don't expect everyone to agree with me. In fact, I welcome disagreement. If something I write makes 				you see a familiar idea from a different perspective, then I think the conversation is worth having.
			</p>

			<h4>What I'm working toward</h4>
			<p>Right now, I'm working toward three big things:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>✈️ Becoming a pilot — working toward my ATPL and turning a lifelong dream into a reality.</li>
				<li>💻 Building and creating — growing my technical skills and building a digital portfolio that reflects what I can do.</li>
				<li>🏋️ Building a fitness business — turning my passion for fitness into something that can help other people, especially beginners.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				And underneath all of that is something simpler: becoming a better version of myself.

				I've had my share of imposter syndrome, especially as a woman in a field where I haven't always felt 				like I belonged. For a long time, it was easy to wonder whether I was good enough to stand beside my 				male peers.

				I'm learning to believe that I belong there—not behind them, but alongside them.
			</p>

			<h4>What you'll find here</h4>
			<h3>📖 Books & Insights</h3>
			<p>My thoughts, reflections, and lessons from the stories I read—especially the ones 				that stay with me long after I close the book.</p>

			<h3>🌱 Habits & Self-Development</h3>
			<p>Things I'm trying, learning, and questioning as I figure out how to build a better 				life.</p>

			<h3>💻 What I'm Learning</h3>
			<p>Technical things I've learned through engineering, projects, and building things 				myself.</p>

			<h3>✈️ Aviation</h3>
			<p>My journey toward becoming a pilot, from the things I'm learning now to the 					experiences that come late.</p>

			<h4>What i believe</h4>
			<p>
				I believe a good life is built by being kind to others and continuing to learn.

				I value consistency, kindness, and the audacity to dream—especially when the 					dream seems a little too big.

				I'm not here because I've figured everything out.

				I'm here because I'm figuring it out in public.

				If you have a minute to spare, welcome. I hope something you find here makes 					you think, inspires you, or simply gives you a different way of looking at 						something.

				And if you disagree with me?

				Even better. Let's talk.
			</p>

		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
